@startuml US_3_2_1_C4_Processos
title US 3.2.1 - Processo de login OIDC

actor User
participant SPA as "AuthService/Login"
participant API as "AuthTestController"
participant IAM as "IAM Provider"

User -> SPA: clicou "Login"
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/login
API -> IAM: redirect authorize (PKCE)
IAM --> API: code
API -> IAM: troca code por tokens
API -> User: set cookie + redirect SPA
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me (withCredentials)
API --> SPA: profile + access_token
SPA -> User: UI autenticada

@enduml
